{"2780850":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Moon-Oriented Autonomous Biological Model","steam_appid":2780850,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2780850\/extras\/5016142222051bad917460b069cb9b96.poster.avif?t=1793718195\" width=504 height=504 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2780850\/extras\/5016142222051bad917460b069cb9b96.webm?t=1793718195\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2780850\/extras\/5016142222051bad917460b069cb9b96.mp4?t=1793718195\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Moon-Oriented Autonomous Biological Model<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Isn't it painful to think for too long? I can't think well because I can't sleep. This, this, this makes me suffer... Will this night protect us? There shouldn't have been things like smartphones... Fly me to the moon. Sometimes I feel an unbearable longing. Ah, what do I do now? Will we be okay? Will our Earth... our Earth... our Earth... Will the inevitable morning sun greet us? Love me... 4:05 is such a boring time. A dull and tedious time. Our time when we don't know where to go. Stories and songs we love will enrich our lives. We'll be okay.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-Feature<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive media art<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short playtime of around 1 hour<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost no combat or puzzle elements<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game where you progress the story by clicking elements on the screen<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-Credits<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Illustration help - ChoiMinQue<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Font, Galmuri9 - C 2019-2023 Minseo Lee <a href=\"mailto:(itoupluk427@gmail.com)\">(itoupluk427@gmail.com)<\/a><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English translation - STONEONE<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Russian translation - snr_nik<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional Chinese translation - JiaXi Yu<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2780850\/extras\/5016142222051bad917460b069cb9b96.poster.avif?t=1793718195\" width=504 height=504 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2780850\/extras\/5016142222051bad917460b069cb9b96.webm?t=1793718195\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2780850\/extras\/5016142222051bad917460b069cb9b96.mp4?t=1793718195\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Moon-Oriented Autonomous Biological Model<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Isn't it painful to think for too long? I can't think well because I can't sleep. This, this, this makes me suffer... Will this night protect us? There shouldn't have been things like smartphones... Fly me to the moon. Sometimes I feel an unbearable longing. Ah, what do I do now? Will we be okay? Will our Earth... our Earth... our Earth... Will the inevitable morning sun greet us? Love me... 4:05 is such a boring time. A dull and tedious time. Our time when we don't know where to go. Stories and songs we love will enrich our lives. We'll be okay.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 